  "Venue-agnostic model output. No betting-venue logic.",
  "away_win_prob/home_win_prob are the model's RAW calibrated confidences (conf/100); sides are scored independently and may not sum to 1.",
  "props[].model_prob = rate-model probability (binomial/DP/Poisson over expected PA) passed through an isotonic calibration map fitted on graded history with as-of-date stats. NOT a rescaled edge_score. Rows flagged FLAT_MAP carry the calibrated base rate only. See prop_calibration for per-type sample sizes and pred-vs-actual.",
  "tier STRONG/LEAN = pick cleared the model's betting thresholds; PASS = context only, not a published pick.",
  "games[].wind = the dashboard's LF/CF/RF decomposition of the park wind; out_mph = strongest out-blowing component. Null when weather wasn't logged.",
  "props[].statcast: barrel_pct/hard_hit_pct/avg_exit_velo (Savant, season-to-date), xiso = xSLG\u2212xBA (Savant expected stats), recent_hr_rate = HR per PA over the last 30 days (null if <10 PA). Nulls mean the source was unavailable \u2014 never fabricated."
